          "mimeType" : "text/html; charset=utf-8",
          "text" : "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ru\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>SQL Injection Lab – Поиск пользователей</title>\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <style>\n    :root{--b:#e5e7eb;--m:#64748b;--bg:#f7f7fb;--bad:#b91c1c}\n    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg)}\n    .wrap{max-width:900px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 16px}\n    .card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.06)}\n    .head{padding:24px 24px 0}\n    .body{padding:0 24px 24px}\n    h1{margin:0 0 6px 0}\n    .note{color:var(--m);font-size:14px;margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.5}\n    .field-label{display:block;font-size:14px;margin:12px 0 4px}\n    input[type=\"text\"]{width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;box-sizing:border-box}\n    button{margin-top:12px;padding:10px 16px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}\n    table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:16px;font-size:14px}\n    th,td{padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--b);text-align:left}\n    th{font-weight:600;background:#f9fafb}\n    .error{margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--bad)}\n    .meta{font-size:12px;color:var(--m);margin-top:8px;word-break:break-all}\n    code{background:#f3f4f6;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 4px;font-size:12px}\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"head\">\n        <h1>Поиск пользователей</h1>\n        <p class=\"note\">\n          Это учебная форма поиска по таблице пользователей. Введите часть имени или e-mail,\n          чтобы получить результаты.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"body\">\n        <form method=\"get\" action=\"/search\">\n          <label class=\"field-label\" for=\"q\">Строка поиска</label>\n          <input id=\"q\" name=\"q\" type=\"text\" value=\"&#39; UNION SELECT NULL,NULL,NULL--\" placeholder=\"например, ali, admin, student\">\n          <button type=\"submit\">Искать</button>\n        </form>\n\n        \n\n\n\n        \n          <h3>Результаты</h3>\n          \n            <table>\n              <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <th>ID</th>\n                  <th>Имя пользователя</th>\n                  <th>E-mail</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                \n                  <tr>\n                    <td>None</td>\n                    <td>None</td>\n                    <td>None</td>\n                  </tr>\n                \n                  <tr>\n                    <td>1</td>\n                    <td>student</td>\n                    <td>student@example.com</td>\n                  </tr>\n                \n                  <tr>\n                    <td>2</td>\n                    <td>alice</td>\n                    <td>alice@example.com</td>\n                  </tr>\n                \n                  <tr>\n                    <td>3</td>\n                    <td>admin</td>\n                    <td>admin@example.com</td>\n                  </tr>\n                \n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          \n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
